250 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 169 0 R
/E (To enhance the effectiveness of the Federal Ethics Committee, it is recommended to establish additional independent review boards to ensure unbiased assessments of malpractice cases, to improve the training and resources available to the committee for thorough investigations, to increase transparency by publishing detailed reports of investigations and outcomes, to provide ongoing training and education for committee members on best practices in medical ethics and investigation techniques, and to develop clearer guidelines and standards for systematic and thorough investigations.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
