/P 182 0 R
/E (banking business for loans or investments in a manner acceptable by the National bank[the bank becomes the owner of the money and lend it at its own risk] are the activities that are essentially define banking business. The others in exclusion of the two are not essential to define basically a banking business or commercial banking. Any given person can do such activities by having just a trader license of such activities, but not essentially having a banking business license or commercial banking business license.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
