/P 182 0 R
/E (Therefore, at the very beginning as enshrined in Art.2\(2\) \(a\) and \(b\) Ato Ayele Debella has not raised money through means that the National Bank has declared to be an authorized manner of receiving funds or use the fund at his risk for loans or investments in a manner acceptable by the National Bank. The court in a different understanding of the definition of banking business or commercial banking declared Ato Ayele Debella was involved in banking business, which left the definition in a paradox.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [8]
>>
