/E (Recently, it was announced that Ethio-telecom, the largest telecom service provider in Ethiopia, was going to be the first company that was going to be listed on the newly established Ethiopian Securities Exchange \(ESX from here on out\). However exciting this news was to people in the cognoscenti, a large section of society was left wondering what the announcement exactly meant. Therefore, in this piece, a modest attempt has been made to clear up the fog of confusion surrounding this recent piece of news.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [4]
>>
