/E (The listing of a security \(equity or share securities in the case of Ethio-telecom on an exchange would in turn allow for those shares to be bought and sold at the exchange. This has obvious advantages for both Ethio-telecom and the public. By issuing shares and selling them on an exchange, Ethio-telecom would get the chance to raise capital, and the public would in turn reap its benefit by purchasing the shares of a company with a glorious past and a bright future and receive dividends from the firm's profits.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
