/T (Issue No.36/2024, Published December 30,2024  The Right to Access Justice in light of the New Court fee Regulation by Mekdelawit Dereje \(mekdelawitdereje11@gmail.com\) )
/E (Issue No.36/2024, Published December 30,2024  The Right to Access Justice in light of the New Court fee Regulation by Mekdelawit Dereje \(mekdelawitdereje11@gmail.com\) )
/Pg 34 0 R
