/Title (Andamlak has gained practical legal experience through diverse roles as a legal intern, legal assistant, extern, and lease expert across various law offices and a government digital services organization. He has also engaged in international legal advocacy, notably participating in the 2024 AfCFTA Moot Court Competition, where he further developed his skills in legal research, and legal writing. His professional interests are centered on financial services law, banking, and capital markets. Currently, Andamlak is working with the Capital Market and Financial Services team at Tsegamlak and Associates \(TSA\) Law Office, where he continues to build expertise in emerging regulatory frameworks and transactional legal practice.)
