/Title (Andamlak Admasu is a law graduate of Addis Ababa University, recognized for his strong academic performance and professional initiative, having graduated with great distinction. During his time as a student, he demonstrated leadership and commitment to legal scholarship by founding the Legal Updates initiative under the Justice Club and serving as its team head in 2023.)
